# Google Cloud service-account keys - these download with an opaque
# project-hash filename (not a predictable "*credentials*" pattern), so if
# you ever re-download one, name it service-account-key.json and it'll be
# caught here. Never commit real credentials regardless of filename.
service-account-key.json
